(1656, 'Let  denote XOR operation. Let 1 and 0 denote the binary constants and F is the Boolean expression over two variables P and Q                          F P, Q = 1 P P Q P Q Q 0 Which of the following is equivalent expression to F?', NULL, '[\"  P Q \", \"  P Q \", \"  P Q \", \"  P Q \"]', 3, 'Computer Science & Engineering', NULL, NULL, 2026, 'flagged', '[{\"code\": \"DUPLICATE_OPTIONS\", \"detail\": \"Duplicate options detected within question\"}]', 'content_quality_auditor', '2026-09-10 10:57:00', '2026-09-09 15:11:21', 1, 'lt-cs-157-159', 'Let  denote XOR operation. Let 1 and 0 denote the binary constants and F is the Boolean expression over two variables P and Q                          F P, Q = 1 P P Q P Q Q 0 Which of the following is equivalent expression to F?', 'auto_cleaned', 0.99, '[\"whitespace_normalization\"]', '2026-09-11T03:14:33.318006+00:00', '2.0.0', 'none'),
